# docker/sandbox.Dockerfile 以 --require-hashes 安裝的雜湊鎖定檔（docker/sandbox-requirements.txt）的直接輸入。
# 版本以 requirements.lock 為約束（-c），容器與 CI 用同一組版本。重新產生：
# Direct inputs of docker/sandbox-requirements.txt, the hashed lock docker/sandbox.Dockerfile installs with
# --require-hashes. Versions are constrained (-c) by requirements.lock so the container matches CI. Regenerate with:
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 -c requirements.lock \
#     docker/sandbox-requirements.in -o docker/sandbox-requirements.txt
pytest
pytest-cov
requests
# hypothesis 讓產生的屬性測試能在容器內執行；它與其相依 sortedcontainers 不在 requirements.lock，版本只由本鎖定檔決定
# hypothesis lets generated property-based tests run in the container; it and its dependency sortedcontainers are
# not in requirements.lock, so this lock alone decides their versions
hypothesis
